DTSTAMP:20260825T070840Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260825
SUMMARY:[Federal Maine-Related] Membership Adjustment of the Mushroom Coun
 cil
DESCRIPTION:This proposed rule invites comments on realigning and realloca
 ting representation on the Mushroom Council as prescribed in the Mushroom 
 Promotion\, Research\, and Consumer Information Order by adjusting the sta
 tes in Regions 1 and 3 and reallocating a member from Region 1 to Region 3
 .\nhttps://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/08/25/2026-17296/members
 hip-adjustment-of-the-mushroom-council
URL:https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/08/25/2026-17296/member
 ship-adjustment-of-the-mushroom-council
CATEGORIES:Federal Maine-Related
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
